      "message": "Daisuke, the Trogdor firmware doesn\u0027t have your recent refactoring CLs that EC passes the display SoC to powerd. So the CONFIG_BATTERY_EXPORT_DISPLAY_SOC just does nothing. EC and powerd both calculate the SoC.\n\nAnd changing CONFIG_BATT_HOST_SHUTDOWN_PERCENTAGE from the default 4% to 2% makes the EC calculation different from the powerd calculation. EC now uses 2% as the display:0%, but powerd still uses 4% as the display:0%. So they show different display SoC.\n\nI think we should revert the CL and use the old way.",
